Thanks for installing OVNI ORBIT 🛸

ORBIT is a free, open-source binaural movement plugin for macOS — place a sound anywhere in
real 3D, set it orbiting, or fly it past with real Doppler.

The plugins install to:
  VST3:  /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3
  AU:    /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components

ORBIT is unsigned. If macOS blocks it the first time, clear the quarantine flag in Terminal:
  xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine "/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/OVNI ORBIT.vst3"

Free and open-source under AGPLv3 · source at github.com/ovniaudio/orbita

More at ovniaudio.com
